---
// Manifesto: one essay, carried verbatim from design/Manifesto.dc.html
// (the composite's copy contains no em dashes; nothing needed dedashing).
// Serif long-form typography per the W2 brief. The notify form posts to
// /api/subscribe; the backend lands at W4, honeypot included now.
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  title="Manifesto · KeepState"
  description="The Session Economy: compute is now billed in agent-hours, and the durable session is the primitive the whole agent economy will be built on."
>
  <main class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7 pt-[84px] pb-24 w-full">
    <div class="max-w-[62ch]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-[9px] mb-5">
        <span class="w-[7px] h-[7px] bg-claret rotate-45 block"></span>
        <span class="text-11 font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-claret">Manifesto</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="font-serif text-34 leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.025em] font-normal mt-0 mb-7">The Session Economy</h1>

      <p class="font-serif text-17 leading-[1.75] text-slate mt-0 mb-10 [text-wrap:pretty]">
        Compute used to be billed in requests, then in tokens. It is now billed in agent-hours: long, stateful, interruptible work that behaves less like an API call and more like an employee's afternoon. That unit has no home. Frameworks orchestrate it, sandboxes host it, nothing keeps it. We think the durable session is the primitive the whole agent economy will be built on, and that the company which keeps that state gets to meter it. The full argument is being written down; leave an address and we will send it when it is finished.
      </p>

      <div class="border-t border-sand pt-7 max-w-[30em]">
        <p class="text-14 font-semibold mt-0 mb-3.5">Get the manifesto when it ships</p>
        <form method="post" action="/api/subscribe" class="flex gap-2.5 flex-wrap">
          <input type="text" name="website" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
          <input
            type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" aria-label="email address"
            class="flex-[1_1_220px] min-w-0 font-sans text-15 text-ink bg-white border border-sand rounded-3 px-3.5 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-claret"
          />
          <button type="submit" class="font-sans text-15 font-medium text-paper bg-claret border-0 rounded-3 px-5 py-3 cursor-pointer hover:bg-ink">Notify me</button>
        </form>
        <p class="font-mono text-11 tracking-[0.06em] text-taupe mt-3.5 mb-0">one email when it ships · nothing else</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Site>
